  offerLine: Moss toast. Twice. Once could be luck.
  activeLine: I'm still waiting on that toast. Moss and mushrooms, it's not hard.
  readyLine: ...All right, that's good. That's actually good. Don't look at me like that. I've got a sweet tooth, and you've got a recipe book now. Berry cake next.
  doneLine: I'm not saying I'm impressed.
